{"version":1,"content":"<p>為迎APEC會議，深圳早前發出「綠色出行」倡議，截至今日（26日）已有54.6萬名車主申報停駛私家車。</p><p>當局以國家一級保護動物、深圳生態代言人「黑臉琵鷺」為主形象，推出APEC深圳通紀念卡及車貼，贈予響應倡議申報停駛的車主。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:30.449452+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:22:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:58:19.288710+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:04.602332+00:00","content_hash":"958a37ed2b4eca1437b5a7de98c285aa6a76da2d1b4f7bbb56ca5ac8d2ec2082","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}